WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.640
All of the joy and excitement and fun that we want in life never comes from external

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:07.640
circumstances.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:14.060
It always comes from the energy and the attention and the consciousness that we bring into each

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:15.480
and every moment.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:19.080
So Laurie, I talked about this a lot and if you really want to solve this problem, I need

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:22.600
you to go read page 10 in my book Make Every Man Want You.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:26.240
It's all about making is-ness your business.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.660
So what does that mean?

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:33.380
Making is-ness your business means that you show up in each moment and you do this moment

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:35.180
like you friggin' mean it.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.060
That means you bring your A-game.

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:42.340
That means you bring your full enthusiasm, your attention, your love to whatever you're

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:46.020
doing, wherever you are and whoever you're with.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:47.020
Why?

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:53.260
Because all pain and frustration and annoyance in our life comes from resisting the moment.

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:56.460
It comes from saying this moment isn't how it should be.

